# Line-ending policy: pin every text file to LF on all platforms.
#
# The build breaks under a CRLF checkout (the Windows core.autocrlf default):
# make recipes, the hack/*.sh shebangs, and Dockerfile RUN lines all fail on
# stray CR bytes. The index stores LF only; these rules keep working trees LF
# too, so clones behave identically on Linux, macOS, and Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalize.
*.png binary
